  "body": "Road7 still differs across the frozen SDK3 RGB runs. PR141 found zero selector values at the CPU base level; this diagnostic adds read-only prepared Texture/GSG cache metadata and four existing attribute-mip1 texels per candidate UV to test the remaining upload-level hypothesis.\n\nThe three terrain-owner textures, six existing output/GSG contexts, 80-byte mip budget, 20-second CPU inspection and 32MiB RSS delta are bounded. It never prepares a texture, generates mipmaps, issues a GPU query/readback, or adds a render. Cold native bootstrap and 146 focused tests pass. Fresh whole-branch review, exact canonical CI and one authenticated native run are pending; this Draft will retain their actual receipts.\n\nOfficial matrix stays 3/4 PASS, overall FAIL, Stage7=false. This stacked Draft is based on PR141. No main merge or environment/registry publication.\n",
